  unitName: Sage Bran
  unitId: 40353
  unitNumber: 539
  description: Legends remain in the Atharva Republic of this great sage. People
    came in droves to seek his council, for his wealth of knowledge rivaled that
    of World Tree Altro. Rumor has it that Weiss, Shida, and Rashil were former pupils
    of Bran's. However, the three would never admit it, perhaps because of his reputation
    of bigotry. Instead, a troubled look would cloud their faces whenever they heard
    his name.
  summonDesc: Summoned by a neophyte.<br>Why do you wish to<br>waste my time, you
    fool?!
  fusionDesc: You fool!<br>Don't you realize strength<br>is incidental?
